# Root build context — keep the image a build of the SOURCE, not the machine.
# Deliberately NOT ignored: apps/ (apps compile into the bundle at build time,
# including gitignored local apps that are part of local builds by design) and
# scripts/ (fleet skills + chassis template ship into the runtime image).

.git
.git/**
**/.git
.github

node_modules
**/node_modules
# …except an app's own: apps are self-contained codebases and compile into the
# bundle as-is (apps/README.md) — their node_modules are source, not something
# this image rebuilds (ui/ and mcp/ get fresh installs; apps/ don't).
!apps/*/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage

# Instance state — never bake a machine's data or credentials into a layer.
fleet
stack
logs
**/.uploads
ui/.env*
docker/searxng/settings.local.yml
**/.env
!**/.env.example

# Not part of any build.
docs
playground
.claude
.inspect
*.md
LICENSE
